  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d92275a6b4ed3370bb2bc9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a81719318f354a289fa32effff3e0060c6af596527f262f806d5f1b7f27b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5791d61b4c15136bd19f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad733a8d94841738b56df6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去看看漫画改编的舞台剧？\r\n……我觉得如果是和你一起去的话，\r\n一定会是一次愉快的体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4178b17350d67ec34dd39361b92f261ab995315fcdbabdffde165ae0652a8ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b485cf9045f14c1e9b27e2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次可以COS一下敌方组织的杀手吗？\n就是穿着金闪闪的西装，\n还带着刺刺护肩的那种！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0016baacc2c4cdcbf172de6803e80ddafac6f7cf4b3ec3e14d63922a9488bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92935574bfea4e7510d28d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新·章·突·入！\r\n带着全新的必杀技，展现出与\r\n更加强大的强敌战斗的身姿吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c0e35668f2a6785f1a7e80c9db49469a932f6d27cca14aa42af2ff2dc98e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0efbeb6f6364de26f1f724f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要不要去看看储物柜？\r\n谁柜子里有巧克力谁就算赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85e7bfe258da2cab22360f9bf4eb92dfaa89ffe3f262f68193b35970964dc628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4c2a4c3c79fbdfd066840c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用纸杯蛋糕！哼……这可是注入了\r\n常人无法承受之『念』的佳作……\r\n你能全部吃完吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71a9ff6fc22a82be566550dde8adac8f9cb7c4e119ff8116fcd47a3ae23eeda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b6dde9125437f0c06f2282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果想要跨越银河，只要张开想象的翅膀\r\n飞翔就好。只要愿望足够强烈，\r\n哪怕是银河的彼端也一定能到达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccddc22838bcd08fa0ebc841726b836824b74e6b29196278d01d7aafe53818f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635a380822a7113c8d6b661d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满大街都是各种作品的COS呢……\r\n总有一天，我的作品也一定能\r\n名列其中……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51cd038a0840a09106a7cd5e57ea7cc8e651024a4eff5a1bab01a5c8e914141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ac2b4f220343c897a292cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我要去参加气槽前辈主持的\r\n派对！有蛋糕还有桌游，\r\n好期待呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a91a215e1790c0505a9451a6dbcb72fc19218ca050019ecc3a86b434e8cee1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5eb19340a08d88fa86176cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前收到的画具套装，现在是不是\r\n还在抽屉里呢。久违地试用一下吧……\r\n那盒20色的蜡笔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971c745c1ff38db2be7187f6aad0a5f79fb0aefda2544018e28d124d103e3d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198c9203ca0a7b32f0f00659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe7548f6a96c3ffbb15ebb1881687fdb27f8c9371c23aa3dfef656a536ac829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef33a332864ca498542a6c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好多仅限年内免费畅读的内容……！\r\n手机、平板还有电脑……\r\n全部用上的话应该能看完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5f953a864c58f3b377c0321d3c28d45717de1a8433b8c96352049f42b64c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd61eed9c9389a6f905d30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝生日我做了『漫画肉』哦♪\r\n用了专门的骨头，在大小、魄力\r\n还有画力表现上都非常讲究呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a17ab6035642c7cb3d777b8c66b0d00a0f24f24461a2a8c966120c9a208f4e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b97ac4ef0b9d8d3603d9f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要打篮球吗？还是要进行异能战斗？\r\n或者是料理对决？今天你才是\r\n主人公！无论什么我都会陪你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "258709579de3f8759e2ad7898dd2582c6db5f4eb225ec61a47b55df22f604d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4bf40323b0af0e45eb083b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给明年的自己，写一封信吧……\r\n——现在的你，\r\n有没有比当时离梦想更近一步了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a95f486be27b92fb75232861d70d8f4520cfe9a4131e5e5598d9e9f8ef47c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de15e3e8138095e3c593402b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想看看你画的画。\r\n请务必让我见识一下，\r\n你内心深处藏着的那些雀跃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14feef9fef88917ac50d95da71650d9a0400dff19c13c00d001f737283521d04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f77cb9645259f6bac52e6c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了。\r\n难道是喜欢的漫画更新\r\n最新一话了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad3fc84f3d6fdfe33c429cfaae2f1a4a27139cfd126f53d5b9a6743719da9ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96590263e1e182830f7e4280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦。要是能让创作\r\n变得更顺利的道具就好了呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273ffad159092d78deea219d971462d6c909c167cbd9e0f24c9ca8001b4033c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1adfa38e4a1f0da04d056ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成！要不要以此为奖励，\r\n进入漫画时间？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc383a008ad01e23732858c7071dc0c7e76b834427673f3e48acb18508beb506",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f63afa65b56e955d18e46a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动快要开始了。\n神业不为人知的秘密终于要\n揭晓了——！？敬请期待下一号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ff08742d7479330f3d54ada670cf2aea9e9133de96d2cc66773655cd44ab2ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f507a4d2e2a96843059e6efc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动举办中。\r\n战斗终于进入了高潮！\r\n这一月号也不要错过哦——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77546c0c02e01ff135d8400d801766f62425fdfa068e616defe71bd967ed21e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ebac544dffd2e59c0da52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5b5a31678ef6a27bc562a56797e1396c6b4717ac8bdbb4ed006b3986707e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f1e0d57ace98bd53c99f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，\r\n名鉴等级提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b9a9660d4b35fb7d73390506aba4ea9636080e69a470c3b3a7f39438ae06e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42af3c604a69859dd21a5945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服穿着很舒服呢。\r\n哪怕弄撒了墨水变脏了，\r\n也可以用力地刷洗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08cec6c4191bf920abd4576c756ae2250475c80ded782d40737359d5614bf1c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dab6b1f9f51a21c38245ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子上的丝带是妹妹推荐给我的。\r\n她说，身为主人公，\r\n不显眼一点可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8e2cb4d1b2e27ef42ea9606e406f9ab5a974b83dd04bbc4e54b324e4945d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57078fa41779a529c413ab89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我们兄弟姐妹全员都会穿\r\n一样的衣服。就是那种设计相同、\r\n颜色不一的套装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc091a0c54adedd93fef7dbe403fee7073e256662314e7e6640a66aa4feae714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eddcfef755cf7da9797a945a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～真有一套啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b807c3dfc06c9d54659202f6859b32eabfd9bd2186ea826d0c52a036a4012048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d6a2cdf0947a782649fc4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们才是胜者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f439cbadb2aabc01fdd65c8b2b1172574363ed43236b5e81caa85d8f3ad71f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ca795db02cf281038d40109",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5b5a31678ef6a27bc562a56797e1396c6b4717ac8bdbb4ed006b3986707e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f72a88804dcf1cda0f48ea8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～真有一套啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b807c3dfc06c9d54659202f6859b32eabfd9bd2186ea826d0c52a036a4012048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280eb112a1b6774722e31253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新高分纪录！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2882f172b1277a8162466945ce1cb61a51897bca21e4c1b4580a9b06a641cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7976a9c1cf443e97c2a24763",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齐心协力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd907fc0e3075c088b53272466bd1e995f66aa3c353b82ddb2f25fe46c133e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de05bfb39bdc47e8cefb57f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6facd863f3cc7ced5fe83198",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练吗？\r\n了解！素材收集的准备工作\r\n已经万无一失了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "423ec30346c67076e8c25ebb713169233ac2dc9a783b2d751e8fa86fbc0b30ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795d7ddf5c6c5dc7901ee07f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然有这么多故事……\r\n唔～总觉得手心痒痒的，\r\n好想画点什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1008d5d22b5ada3c2b05e9a5e2618eb9250c0d1b8b1c8b8d9197ad19d44fbc64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:035614eed2f8844f988d3b80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛了吗！哼……\r\n终于到了尝试新必杀技的\r\n时候了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77093ab43619a68d424ccf21d86ea2579548a4923088974765516729b87d7d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb0abfcfdf12b6985861263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b36ceafa459ae7945f0e5cc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全·力以赴——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6842b8f7b9f945c79d2d2f5de8209c3af5c1fc5205e767d7bdbc65b5325fafa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af04bc521bab89a56e2e440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们才是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b3631cef7688a572950ee88b4c1462865f5875a9ba1b2547e245d9cf7694c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a827c2ba163a4e4b3910b55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7e857511d8f5ef5f0fe68a705513be25e1f03293e446e5e256a36a024e0569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2874c3005b570f4ccd7bbde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一击必杀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15922a5a19f14d80dd92f86dbb173295fbff2fd2492c782615150e0a51cb87ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e545681e88e92e2853ea7d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af53b2b61cebf960970ddb2edf5f62fe1db2c93375023524d21e4e05df32e2bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e856a345b075b9f92985a35a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊差……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7499461ade75f3c86d882879eb45fd32601aa11164462c90698a0dec3af2d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17025085e57cf59de543fe30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉都能演人偶剧了呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e6a90a7ab72735cb7a9bc13ca334f2f3ee4f702ecaefdeda2eae0e1b888527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5b12fa36e4a453a2f0e1ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真有一套呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5f2128f58d448b6a0398f14a380dfd2996634218c6503ba0d9f5a39f0775cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38cf5c8c1e868c1cd168b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只能期待下一次了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "505377e1d87040d71ea531cb0ed7da207668224e336459005d4d70e922208348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2634e2c60f21dff1da04ac77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉都能演人偶剧了呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e6a90a7ab72735cb7a9bc13ca334f2f3ee4f702ecaefdeda2eae0e1b888527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d95b7fbeee44ec0b870b79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真有一套呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5f2128f58d448b6a0398f14a380dfd2996634218c6503ba0d9f5a39f0775cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece0b00b02bc1fc4bb4fce7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a1d775a0129c08df29e89b6b4261d8544c5e373ef4db0cb2e4af18dbe63f47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5451f13e764f81ac9ae3f958",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7990e29ba73adbb25caf3a56bd6650d89178b313c21bbc997967b4db791ccd69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5709303132f5631abc39675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3960d0c6ac3e5fcce71a62a4636e2aac57e005fba3bca1d197b9a698432e9506",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601c393cfcf96cad9dea89cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大好机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "259cfcf2fdb302486b6861d0605fc47808898ffef5a952ecb5aa1d5a9140ec81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ffa7f187950df39827b8d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c922c5de8a35921e2086ab355870227069194ca65614c757deb698452d7f0151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5832e24a9b60c9e68e8d36ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样冲下去……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d743f9ee04faae41e3c83408cb52b2956f9c32a0c839f7bb80f57d4d93445c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f3d0ae5bc910599f6aedd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e34abed1ddb126fde54bfedaf035b92aac16d1e143243cc656102c6ded090c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be312b80af64a9d9835d83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来看看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2dd064ec22d78d1674a878c9a6c5c52aac469b4ce9a74edbef773529901dd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e4501bff080074b6ec1ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意力断线了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bda942ab91f20aa0dc52cddc2850a0813eb7c27d46e8f0351a4dadd5e551a4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2ecc47fcf34e3ef9b8b072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会这样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7361f5829959d86115a610f22a01a4d3965036ea076cb10e40c35ee860e546e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a89af884c2d51073bdbfdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b08a445830f60f831cc69715bfe607a664dd20f0eb7a6b5add5663dfe83b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cd9c4a877bce88e7956b52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天会为您准备这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94587e1b8fc61b6f9fa9990733607ce80565cb9f95a96a5b129a30a21de859d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399424c57f7500f320a92707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创意枯竭中~……\n寻求素材~…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbf28ff42f390b393f0ee2ef37d76b8c2b668d76e6503acacbcc1fb0ea2bf75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9f686dbb5cb88be48690aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……好想有一段可以\r\n悠闲看漫画的时间啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88ca018a95e1f9b4b74775aaaa29b7173634144c6343813bb39754248a0b269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b95d39fde9a708d749532c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我甚至能发动最终咏唱……\r\n『迸发者为闪光……烙印者为洁白印记\r\n定罪蒙昧之暗——光阵！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b2fcaa876417a42afbaba52286459641dbf77d7b6d6c83885b4ed6ed05f31c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1348c90480c9388df334bee7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸怀那遥远岁月的青涩憧憬——\r\n我的画笔，今日亦在咆哮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a026eca3f49b87236a74c473b6bf950793da517d1f9147cb71adddfeac9454bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91053004b8a8fc4c558c821a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔噢～情绪燃起来了！\r\n请告诉我，这份炽热的情感\r\n该宣泄到何处才好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "093139035d242b0d3e4b583a2fb6df14f08103e0b2bfff359200e095ef4abe5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1fed09fe00d3d6684cd6dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在要是有邪恶组织敢入侵赛道……\r\n我就用我的『爆裂旋风脚』\r\n把他们踢成粉碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50dc2d272106f54bf1bc38cc4c9249bbf0302672814e682d4a8ec663e2c43868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d68955bb82592e558b8e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有很多想要尝试的想法。\r\n可以的话，\r\n能听我讲讲吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b23000ef2305956341aea875bc77f7eabf39980c94ae5e7970f25ffb404454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a71fd15722eaa5c6737e4c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯？那位用锐利目光注视着\n赛道的赛马娘……她有着怎样的\n背景故事呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2d1e403dacbfbef99c4f952508ec6122f6eb5869c1bedd8c306497348a9d30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f7837866384386d55d1149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然身体有点沉重，但还\n远没结束……！我的韧性\n可是超乎想象的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aea8abec7daa4affb04de641ffce7f12c06fd9d2acb6b3061744b243c7770f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a19399ae877e7a03949033b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……\r\n是不是画画太投入了……\r\n我的颈、颈椎病要犯了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a00ef3cc7a7b64924a3c31b5dcd91d5398f44026afdc1b25a706870e6388c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09a640e723ec3a8d2526b98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将这股难以言喻的慵懒感，\r\n转化为创作的力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a35b144e4963a5cee43998d7028df7237de2c88c8e3fde3985ca07694142469",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5ed1110c8dbf4f4757f567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可原谅……昨天的我……\r\n为什么要合并图层啊……\r\n呜呜……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c94cdb8b9de26ccf4606407f4c6f770e512f40fb7d761d8ba95e9320befb0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb556d4e03aa37e1d52a9e90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……没有输入就无法\n产生输出嘛……\n要不要稍微考虑一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62c15c9177287bdb7a9093e0e0d51dbbca7562ed303ec57e62766c5f55c73b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a5c592a2fcf8f3cb8a7d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不不不，不行的啦……！\r\n身体才是创作的本钱，\r\n不能胡来啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c69287d6efda8e5d0ae0f03562c8ae5f163def49d8c78caf6c9200927c03603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c324978be3a5a22daa4d6bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好勒，斗志满满！状态绝佳！\r\n现在的我感觉连画20页、不，\r\n画40页原稿都没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95bc93308df8fd426110bec39d7291b056edba35b3747b47fa90776180dbd580",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f66e4002c6494fef5e09100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灵魂在燃烧！斗志在沸腾！\r\n感觉马上就要大爆炸了！\r\n喔喔喔喔——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38a9da1c23861395b8642ad16e9bfb6b8d530b27ff7878fbd130ab6b524f6a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:132893a30b0c40230d9678b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这胸中的悸动……颤抖……！\r\n我要全部、全部发挥出来，去创造——\r\n足以留在心底的名留青史之战！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "febaed5fb0ad706a06b0a17ba18b9c5ce58d95bc63ac170d4eee6cbe8b635ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b092cdbdcc45b0730ad9c046",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全身涌现出勇气！\n来吧，高举拳头——\n『勇者冲击』！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce32da31189c38decfc5561b725febee091f999b6dee80612f8badd27dd0af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d32bc371aabc67c58dc626",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……\r\n今天就让你见识一下，\r\n我的『神业』吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "454418048bc8cf7f59a25a0dcee71fa86e7583c369d00bb0b9f70ca40ebaea41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "20027"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
